==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|NL.|hidrōsis}}, from {{der|en|grc|ἱδρώς||sweat}} + {{m|la|-sis}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|hidroses}}

# {{lb|en|physiology|medicine}} The formation and excretion of [[sweat]].
#: {{syn|en|sweating#Noun|perspiration|;|q3=in medical usage|diaphoresis|sudation|sudoresis}}
#: {{ant|en|adiaphoresis|anhidrosis}}
#: {{hypo|en|q=excessive degree|hyperhidrosis}}
## {{lb|en|physiology|medicine|sometimes|more particularly}} Excessive [[sweating]]; excessive [[perspiration]] (more than would be expected in response to a given stimulus; especially when [[profuse]] as a [[symptom]] of [[disease]] or a [[side effect]] of a [[drug]]).
##: {{syn|en|hyperhidrosis}}

